---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base title="Terms of Use | Laso" description="Laso Terms of Use. Subscription terms, health disclaimer, and conditions for using the Laso app.">

  <!-- Nav -->
  <nav aria-label="Page navigation" class="sticky top-0 z-50 backdrop-blur-xl bg-white/80 border-b border-black/[0.06]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 h-14 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-[22px] font-bold text-[#1d1d1f] tracking-tight hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">Laso</a>
      <a href="/" class="text-[14px] text-[#0071e3] hover:underline">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Main content -->
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-14">

    <!-- Title -->
    <div class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="text-[32px] font-bold text-[#1d1d1f] tracking-tight mb-2">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="text-[14px] text-[#6e6e73]">Effective Date: February 26, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
        These Terms of Use ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the Laso mobile application (the "App"), operated by Laso Health ("we," "us," or "our"). By downloading, installing, or using the App, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the App.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mt-4">
        These Terms apply to all users of the App, including visitors, free users, and subscribers. Please read them carefully before using Laso. Our <a href="/privacy" class="text-[#0071e3] hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> explains how we handle your data and is incorporated by reference into these Terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 1: Health Disclaimer -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-4">1. Health Disclaimer: NOT Medical Advice</h2>

      <div class="bg-[#f5f5f7] rounded-2xl p-6 mb-5">
        <p class="text-[15px] text-[#1d1d1f] font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Laso is a personal wellness and informational tool only. It is <strong>not</strong> a medical device, clinical diagnostic tool, or substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        By using the App, you acknowledge and agree to the following:
      </p>

      <ul class="space-y-3 text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed list-none">
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span><strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Informational only.</strong> All data, scores, insights, trends, and recommendations provided by Laso are for general informational and wellness purposes only. They do not constitute medical advice.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span><strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Do not use to diagnose.</strong> Do not use Laso or any information it provides to self-diagnose or treat any health condition, illness, or injury. Do not disregard or delay seeking professional medical advice because of anything you read or see in the App.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span><strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Always consult a healthcare professional.</strong> If you have questions about your health, a medical condition, or any symptoms you are experiencing, consult a qualified physician, nurse, or other licensed healthcare provider before making any health-related decisions.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span><strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Call emergency services if needed.</strong> In a medical emergency, call your local emergency number (e.g., 911 in the US) or go to the nearest emergency room immediately. Do not rely on Laso in an emergency situation.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span><strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Accuracy depends on wearable sensors.</strong> The health data displayed in Laso is sourced from Apple HealthKit and connected wearable devices. The accuracy and reliability of this data depend entirely on the hardware sensors and algorithms of those devices. Laso makes no representation or warranty regarding the accuracy of sensor-derived measurements.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 2: Eligibility -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-4">2. Eligibility</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-3">
        You must be at least 13 years of age to use Laso. By using the App, you represent and warrant that you meet this minimum age requirement. If you are under 18, you represent that a parent or legal guardian has reviewed and agreed to these Terms on your behalf.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
        Laso requires iOS 17.0 or later. By using the App, you confirm that your device meets this requirement. We do not guarantee compatibility with any operating system version below iOS 17.0.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 3: Account & Access -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-4">3. Account &amp; Access</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Laso does not require you to create an account or provide personal credentials to use the App. The App operates entirely on your device and integrates with Apple HealthKit to access your health data locally.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Your health data is accessed through Apple HealthKit and processed on your device. We do not upload, transmit, or store your personal health data on our servers. All analysis is performed locally on your iPhone.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
        You are solely responsible for maintaining the security of your device and the privacy of your health information. We strongly recommend using device-level security features such as Face ID, Touch ID, or a strong passcode to protect access to your device and the Laso app.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 4: Subscriptions & Payments -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-6">4. Subscriptions &amp; Payments</h2>

      <!-- 4.1 -->
      <div class="mb-7">
        <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-3">4.1 Subscription Plan</h3>
        <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Laso Pro is available as an <strong>annual subscription only</strong>. No monthly subscription is offered. Subscription pricing is tiered by region as follows:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-[#f5f5f7] rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-4">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-1">Standard Regions: $29.99 / year</p>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-[#6e6e73] leading-relaxed">United States, Canada, United Kingdom, European Union member states, Australia, Japan, New Zealand, South Korea, Taiwan, Hong Kong, and other comparable markets.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-black/[0.06] pt-4">
            <p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-1">Reduced-Price Regions: $14.99 / year</p>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-[#6e6e73] leading-relaxed">India, Brazil, Mexico, Southeast Asia (including Indonesia, Philippines, Thailand, Vietnam, Malaysia), African markets, and other emerging economy regions as determined by App Store pricing tiers.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-black/[0.06] pt-4">
            <p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-1">Premium Regions: $34.99 / year</p>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-[#6e6e73] leading-relaxed">Switzerland, Norway, Denmark, Sweden, Singapore, Luxembourg, and other high cost-of-living markets as determined by App Store pricing tiers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-[#6e6e73] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Prices shown are in USD and are approximate. Your local currency equivalent is displayed at checkout. Actual pricing is set by the Apple App Store and may vary by region. <strong class="text-[#424245]">No monthly subscription is offered.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4.2 -->
      <div class="mb-7">
        <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-3">4.2 Free Trial</h3>
        <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
          New subscribers may be eligible for a 7-day free trial of Laso Pro. During the trial period, you have full access to all Pro features. If you do not cancel before the trial period ends, the trial will automatically convert to a paid annual subscription and your payment method will be charged the applicable annual fee for your region. You will not receive a separate notification at the end of your trial; it is your responsibility to cancel before the trial period concludes if you do not wish to be charged.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4.3 -->
      <div class="mb-7">
        <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-3">4.3 Auto-Renewal</h3>
        <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
          Your Laso Pro annual subscription automatically renews at the end of each billing year unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the current billing period. Renewal charges will be applied to your Apple ID account at the rate confirmed at the time of your original purchase, or any updated rate we have previously notified you of. You can manage and turn off auto-renewal at any time through your Apple ID account settings.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4.4 -->
      <div class="mb-7">
        <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-3">4.4 How to Cancel</h3>
        <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-3">
          To cancel your Laso Pro subscription, follow these steps on your iPhone:
        </p>
        <ol class="space-y-2 text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed list-none">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#0071e3] text-white text-[11px] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">1</span>
            <span>Open the <strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Settings</strong> app on your iPhone.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#0071e3] text-white text-[11px] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">2</span>
            <span>Tap your <strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">name</strong> at the top of the screen.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#0071e3] text-white text-[11px] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">3</span>
            <span>Tap <strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Subscriptions</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#0071e3] text-white text-[11px] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">4</span>
            <span>Find and tap <strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Laso</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#0071e3] text-white text-[11px] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">5</span>
            <span>Tap <strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Cancel Subscription</strong> and confirm.</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mt-4">
          Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current annual billing period. You will retain access to Laso Pro features until that date. <strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">No partial refunds are provided</strong> for unused portions of a billing period, except where required by applicable law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4.5 -->
      <div class="mb-7">
        <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-3">4.5 Payment Processing</h3>
        <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
          All payments are processed exclusively by Apple through the Apple App Store. We do not collect, store, or have access to your payment card information, billing address, or any other payment details. All billing inquiries, disputes, and refund requests must be directed to Apple. You can request a refund from Apple at <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com" class="text-[#0071e3] hover:underline">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4.6 -->
      <div class="mb-2">
        <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-3">4.6 Price Changes</h3>
        <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
          We reserve the right to change subscription pricing at any time. If we change the price of your subscription, we will notify you in advance via an in-app notification or through Apple's standard subscription price change notification system. Price changes take effect at the start of the next billing period following the notice. Your continued use of Laso Pro after a price change constitutes your agreement to the new pricing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 5: Acceptable Use -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-4">5. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        You agree to use Laso only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms. You agree not to:
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed list-none">
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Reverse engineer, decompile, disassemble, or attempt to derive the source code of the App or any portion thereof.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Copy, reproduce, distribute, republish, sell, or sublicense any portion of the App or its content without our prior written consent.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Remove, alter, or obscure any proprietary notices, labels, or marks on or within the App.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Use the App for any unlawful purpose or in violation of any applicable local, state, national, or international law or regulation.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Interfere with, disrupt, or attempt to gain unauthorized access to any server, network, or system connected to Laso or its services.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Use any output, insight, or data from the App to provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment recommendations to other individuals.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Use automated tools, bots, or scripts to access, scrape, or interact with the App in any unauthorized manner.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 6: Intellectual Property -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-4">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-3">
        The Laso App, including its design, code, algorithms, text, graphics, logos, icons, images, audio clips, and all other content and materials, is owned by Laso Health and is protected by applicable copyright, trademark, patent, trade secret, and other intellectual property or proprietary rights laws. All rights not expressly granted in these Terms are reserved by Laso Health.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Your use of the App does not grant you any ownership interest in the App or any of its content. You may not use any Laso trademarks, service marks, logos, or trade names without our prior written permission.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
        Your health data remains entirely yours. Laso Health does not claim any ownership rights over your personal health data. The App accesses your health data solely to provide you with the App's features and functionality. Your health data is processed locally on your device and is not transmitted to Laso Health's servers.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 7: Third-Party Services -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-4">7. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Laso integrates with certain third-party services and platforms. Your use of these third-party services is governed by their respective terms of service and privacy policies, not by these Terms. We encourage you to review those policies carefully.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed list-none mb-4">
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span><strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Apple HealthKit.</strong> The App reads health and fitness data from Apple HealthKit. Your use of HealthKit is subject to Apple's terms and privacy policy. Data read from HealthKit is used solely to provide you with the App's features.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span><strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Firebase (Google).</strong> The App uses Firebase Analytics and Firebase Remote Config, services provided by Google LLC. These services are used to understand aggregate, anonymous usage patterns and to deliver app configuration updates. Your use of these features is subject to Google's Privacy Policy and Terms of Service.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span><strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Apple StoreKit.</strong> In-app purchases and subscription management are handled through Apple's StoreKit framework and the Apple App Store. All payment transactions are governed by Apple's Media Services Terms and Conditions.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
        Apple, Apple Watch, iPhone, HealthKit, and other Apple product names are trademarks of Apple Inc. Garmin and related marks are trademarks of Garmin Ltd. Fitbit is a trademark of Google LLC. Whoop is a trademark of WHOOP, Inc. Oura is a trademark of Oura Health Oy. Samsung and Galaxy are trademarks of Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd. TAG Heuer is a trademark of TAG Heuer SA (LVMH). Fossil and Skagen are trademarks of Fossil Group, Inc. Casio and G-Shock are trademarks of Casio Computer Co., Ltd. Omron is a trademark of Omron Corporation. Dexcom is a trademark of Dexcom, Inc. Freestyle Libre and LibreLink are trademarks of Abbott Laboratories. Peloton is a trademark of Peloton Interactive, Inc. Ultrahuman is a trademark of Ultrahuman Inc. All other trademarks and brand names referenced in the App or these Terms are the property of their respective owners. Reference to these brands does not imply any affiliation, endorsement, or partnership with Laso Health.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 8: Disclaimer of Warranties -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-4">8. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-3">
        TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, THE APP IS PROVIDED ON AN "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Laso Health expressly disclaims all warranties, whether express, implied, statutory, or otherwise, including but not limited to:
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed list-none mb-4">
