          <span>Any warranty regarding the accuracy, reliability, completeness, timeliness, or usefulness of any data, scores, insights, or content provided by the App.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Any warranty that the App will be uninterrupted, error-free, secure, or free of viruses or other harmful components.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Any warranty that defects in the App will be corrected or that the App will meet your specific requirements or expectations.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
        Some jurisdictions do not allow the exclusion of implied warranties. In such jurisdictions, the above exclusions apply to the fullest extent permitted by law.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 9: Limitation of Liability -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-4">9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-3">
        TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, IN NO EVENT SHALL LASO HEALTH, ITS OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, AGENTS, LICENSORS, OR SERVICE PROVIDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, PUNITIVE, OR EXEMPLARY DAMAGES, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO:
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed list-none mb-4">
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Loss of profits, revenue, data, goodwill, or other intangible losses.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Personal injury or property damage arising from your use of or inability to use the App.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Any health-related outcomes, decisions, or consequences resulting from your reliance on App data, scores, or insights.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Unauthorized access to or alteration of your transmissions or data.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-[6px] shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6e6e73]"></span>
          <span>Any other matter relating to the App, even if Laso Health has been advised of the possibility of such damages.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed mb-3">
        <strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Aggregate Liability Cap.</strong> To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Laso Health's total cumulative liability to you for all claims arising out of or relating to these Terms or the App shall not exceed the total amount you paid to Laso Health (net of any amounts retained by Apple) during the twelve (12) months immediately preceding the event giving rise to the claim.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
        <strong class="text-[#1d1d1f]">Reliance at your own risk.</strong> You expressly acknowledge and agree that your reliance on any output, score, insight, recommendation, or data provided by the App is entirely at your own risk. Laso Health shall not be liable for any decisions you make or actions you take based on App output.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 10: Indemnification -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-4">10. Indemnification</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#424245] leading-relaxed">
        You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless Laso Health and its officers, directors, employees, agents, licensors, and service providers from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, judgments, awards, losses, costs, expenses, or fees (including reasonable attorneys' fees) arising out of or relating to: (a) your violation of these Terms; (b) your use of or access to the App; (c) your violation of any applicable law or regulation; (d) your violation of any third-party rights, including without limitation any intellectual property rights or privacy rights; or (e) any claim that your conduct caused damage to a third party. This obligation will survive the termination of these Terms and your use of the App.
      </p>
    </section>

